    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Terminator Assault Squad",
    "summary": "As the battle begins, you may put 1 Teleport Homer token on the battlefield for this unit. If you do:\n\n- When this unit is picked as the target of the **[Rapid Ingress stratagem](vsdata:ability/core.rapid-ingress)**, you may use the token. That use costs 1 CP less, but the unit must be placed within 3\" of the token and more than 8\" from every enemy unit, and the token is then removed.\n- The token is also removed if an enemy unit finishes a move 1\" or less from it.",
